---
// Tinnitus Değerlendirme — /degerlendirme/tinnitus-degerlendirme. Fifth
// page of the "Değerlendirme" series (see header.data.ts's servicesMega
// first column), following Ücretsiz İşitme Testi, Odyometri,
// Timpanometri and Çocuk İşitme Testi. Same clinical service-page genre
// and full health-content safety discipline (self-diagnosis
// disclaimers, urgent-care flags for unilateral/pulsatile tinnitus).
//
// Distinct from the existing /teknolojiler/tinnitus-cozumleri page: that
// page covers device-side sound-generator/fractal-tone support
// technology; this page covers the assessment process that comes first
// (history, audiometry, pitch/loudness matching, THI questionnaire).
// technology.ts's "maskeleme-denemesi" item and recommended-brands.ts
// both cross-reference the Tinnitus Çözümleri page rather than
// re-explaining its content.
//
// accentColor: zümrüt yeşili / emerald-600 (#059669) — fifth color in
